WEBVTT

00:00:03.233 --> 00:00:07.138
Every report lives under Reports in the admin menu.

00:00:07.138 --> 00:00:09.535
They are grouped by category:

00:00:09.535 --> 00:00:16.863
Operations, Agent Performance, Queue and Routing, Workforce and Payroll, CRM and Campaigns, and more.

00:00:17.377 --> 00:00:19.972
Reports itself opens the Reports page:

00:00:19.972 --> 00:00:24.867
one card for each report you may open, with a line that says what it answers.

00:00:25.417 --> 00:00:28.634
Click a card, or pick the report from the menu.

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:31.607
Here it is Call insights, under Operations.

